{
  "schema": "pelican.studio_scenario",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "gui_build_C",
  "description": "GB-1 target C (bloom loop), from File > New Project > Blank with Studio's GUI only. A forward material pass from the Graph tab's palette and a Cube (as gui_build_A), and the scene's KeyLight at intensity 6 in the Inspector, so the box is bright enough to pass a threshold. Add fullscreen pass in the root is the bright pass, fed the material pass's colour by a drag onto its + input; Add loop, Add fullscreen pass into its body, Count 4 typed, the bright pass's output dropped on the body pass (a loop input), the body's output on the zone's right edge, the carry drawn back onto the boundary input, and the body image's extent_scale pill as 0.5. The engine expands the loop four times, each copy reading the one before. The bright pass then draws with engine://bloom_highpass, picked from the Pass fields' Fragment list (RS-8: no define needed). UX-5c, decision 1: the loop's output dropped on present's + input is sent as loop.color (RS-13), not as an image of the loop's last copy; the engine takes it, puts present after the last copy, and the frame plan's loop_outputs says loop.color read loop/3/render_fullscreen__color, which present's row shows (← loop.color → loop/3/...); the line is drawn from the loop's output, and the viewport shows the bright part of the box. Then a second root fullscreen pass is the composite: the material pass's colour and the loop's output onto its + input in that order, and engine://bloom_composite picked from the Fragment list (RS-11: no intensity port; the shader adds the second input, times 2, to the first). Its output dropped on present's connected input replaces the loop's; the plan runs the composite after the loop's last copy, and the viewport's box is the scene with its bloom added (brighter than the bloom alone). UX-5d: the body's image is then picked, its Size row's f pressed and Half each element pressed (nothing typed): extent_scale becomes {\"$expr\": \"1 / pow2(element + 1)\"}, the copies shrink one by one, and the bloom spreads past the box -- the points just above and below it, the corner's black before, are lit. They are read on the middle column, 0.243 and 0.756 of the picture's height, in the middle of the spread: the run holds the viewport at 720x450 (studio_drive.py), where the box's top and bottom are rows 116 and 333, the half-size images blur them by 1 pixel before the spread, and the spread reaches 11 pixels past them (the 1/16 image's texels, about 28 pixels, upsampled), so each point is 5 or 6 pixels from both. Where it still stops: the body pass draws with engine://passthrough (no blur shader is picked). Typed: the project folder and name, material_pass in the palette filter, 6 in the light's intensity, 4 in Count, and 0.5.",
  "tab": "frame_plan",
  "probe_no_automation": false,
  "steps": [
    {
      "label": "the fixture's engine is up, so the switch to the new project is something that happens",
      "cmd": "wait_engine",
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "label": "File > New Project...",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.file.newProject"
    },
    {
      "label": "the dialog is on screen",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "the folder: this run's own artifacts",
      "cmd": "type",
      "name": "pelican.newProject.location",
      "text": "{artifacts}"
    },
    {
      "label": "the name",
      "cmd": "type",
      "name": "pelican.newProject.name",
      "text": "gb_c"
    },
    {
      "label": "the Blank pipeline template",
      "cmd": "select",
      "name": "pelican.newProject.template",
      "text": "Blank pipeline"
    },
    {
      "label": "Create",
      "cmd": "click",
      "name": "pelican.newProject.create"
    },
    {
      "label": "the dialog closed",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.newProjectDialog",
      "missing": true,
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "the blank project's present is on the Frame Plan canvas",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.framePlanLogicalView::node#present",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "label": "the new engine answers and has presented frames",
      "cmd": "wait_engine",
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "frames": 30
    },
    {
      "label": "the Graph tab is in front",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.view.renderTools.graph"
    },
    {
      "label": "the canvas has read the new document and can edit it",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode",
      "enabled": true,
      "timeout_ms": 120000
    },
    {
      "label": "Add: the palette opens",
      "cmd": "click",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasAddNode"
    },
    {
      "label": "the palette is on screen",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "the filter narrows the list to the material pass",
      "cmd": "type",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter",
      "text": "material_pass"
    },
    {
      "label": "the contract combo is offered for it",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteContract",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "a forward pass",
      "cmd": "select",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteContract",
      "text": "forward_opaque_v1"
    },
    {
      "label": "Enter in the filter is OK",
      "cmd": "key",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPaletteFilter",
      "sequence": "Return"
    },
    {
      "label": "the palette closed",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPalette",
      "missing": true,
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "the pass's draw loop is drawn as a zone (after the restart the route default asks for)",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_zone#render_material_pass_draws",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 180000
    },
    {
      "label": "the engine answers and has presented frames",
      "cmd": "wait_engine",
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "frames": 30
    },
    {
      "label": "the material pass is drawn",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#render_material_pass",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "the frame plan runs its draw loop",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "loops[0].tier",
      "value": "draw_loop",
      "retry_ms": 120000
    },
    {
      "label": "Add Object > Cube",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.outliner.addObject.cube"
    },
    {
      "label": "the engine has a Cube",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "scene_tree",
      "params": {
        "scene_id": "default_scene"
      },
      "path": "objects[2].name",
      "value": "Cube",
      "retry_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "the Inspector has read the Cube",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorModelChoice",
      "text": "Cube (built-in)",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "pick the key light",
      "cmd": "select",
      "name": "pelican.outliner",
      "text": "KeyLight"
    },
    {
      "label": "the Inspector holds it",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorSelection",
      "contains": "KeyLight\n",
      "timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "label": "let the Inspector settle",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorNotice",
      "contains": "zz-never-shown",
      "timeout_ms": 1500,
      "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"
    },
    {
      "label": "its intensity takes input",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorNumeric.light.intensity",
      "visible": true,
      "enabled": true,
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "a light bright enough to bloom: 6",
      "cmd": "type",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorNumeric.light.intensity",
      "text": "6"
    },
    {
      "label": "commit it",
      "cmd": "key",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorNumeric.light.intensity",
      "sequence": "Return"
    },
    {
      "label": "the scene's light is 6",
      "expect": "result",
      "command": {
        "cmd": "rpc",
        "method": "get_components",
        "params": {
          "name": "KeyLight"
        }
      },
      "path": "result.components[0].authored_json.intensity",
      "value": 6.0,
      "retry_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "label": "File > Save Scene",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.file.saveScene"
    },
    {
      "label": "the save is done",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorNotice",
      "contains": "Scene saved",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "pick the camera, so no gizmo is drawn over the box",
      "cmd": "select",
      "name": "pelican.outliner",
      "text": "MainCamera"
    },
    {
      "label": "the Inspector holds the camera",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.inspectorSelection",
      "contains": "MainCamera\n",
      "timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "label": "the Graph tab is in front again",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.view.renderTools.graph"
    },
    {
      "label": "fit the graph",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "Add fullscreen pass in the root: the bright pass",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.addFullscreenPass"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "auto layout",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.autoLayout"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "the scene colour into the bright pass's + input",
      "cmd": "drag",
      "from": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_material_pass/out:color"
      },
      "to": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_fullscreen/in:variadic"
      },
      "steps": 8
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "the bright pass reads the material pass's colour",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_graph_instances",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[5].inputs.color_2.node",
      "value": "render_material_pass",
      "retry_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "Add loop",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.addLoop"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "zone",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_zone#loop",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "auto layout",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.autoLayout"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "pick zone",
      "cmd": "click",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#loop"
    },
    {
      "label": "loop fields",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLoop.count",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "Add fullscreen pass into the body",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.addFullscreenPass"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "pick zone",
      "cmd": "click",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#loop"
    },
    {
      "label": "count field",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLoop.count",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "count 4",
      "cmd": "type",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLoop.count",
      "text": "4"
    },
    {
      "label": "Enter",
      "cmd": "key",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasLoop.count",
      "sequence": "Return"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "the engine has taken Count 4 (the zone is drawn at its final size before the drag)",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "loops[0].count",
      "value": 4,
      "retry_ms": 120000
    },
    {
      "label": "let the canvas settle",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "contains": "zz-never-shown",
      "timeout_ms": 2000,
      "expect_error": "automation.wait_timeout@1"
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "zoom out under the readable floor, so the bright pass and the body are both on screen",
      "cmd": "wheel",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView",
      "delta": -480
    },
    {
      "label": "the bright pass's output onto the body pass's + input",
      "cmd": "drag",
      "from": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#render_fullscreen/out:color"
      },
      "to": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#loop_body/render_fullscreen/in:variadic"
      },
      "steps": 8
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "the body pass's output onto the zone's right-edge slot",
      "cmd": "drag",
      "from": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#loop_body/render_fullscreen/out:color"
      },
      "to": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_zone_socket#loop/out:+"
      },
      "steps": 8
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "the boundary input's value socket is drawn again after the save",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#loop_body/color/value",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "carry: the body output's inside end back onto the boundary input",
      "cmd": "drag",
      "from": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_zone_socket#loop/out:color"
      },
      "to": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#loop_body/color/value"
      },
      "steps": 8
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "the loop is fed by the bright pass",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_graph_instances",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[6].inputs.color.node",
      "value": "render_fullscreen",
      "retry_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "the body declares its output",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_graph_instances",
      "params": {},
      "path": "definitions.loop_body.outputs.color.node",
      "value": "render_fullscreen"
    },
    {
      "label": "and the loop carries color into color",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_graph_instances",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[6].parameters.carry[0].to",
      "value": "color"
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "zoom in over the body image's extent_scale pill",
      "cmd": "wheel",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_value_pill#loop_body/render_fullscreen__color/extent_scale",
      "delta": 720
    },
    {
      "label": "click it",
      "cmd": "click",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_value_pill#loop_body/render_fullscreen__color/extent_scale"
    },
    {
      "label": "half size",
      "cmd": "type",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_inline_editor#loop_body/render_fullscreen__color/extent_scale",
      "text": "0.5"
    },
    {
      "label": "Return",
      "cmd": "key",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_inline_editor#loop_body/render_fullscreen__color/extent_scale",
      "sequence": "Return"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "into an image at half the screen's size",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_graph_instances",
      "params": {},
      "path": "definitions.loop_body.nodes[0].parameters.extent_scale",
      "value": 0.5,
      "retry_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "label": "the engine expands the loop four times",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "loops[0].count",
      "value": 4,
      "retry_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "copy 1 stands after copy 0 in the frame plan",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[4].name",
      "value": "loop/1/render_fullscreen",
      "retry_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "and reads what copy 0 drew (the carry)",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[4].reads[0]",
      "value": "loop/0/render_fullscreen__color"
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "pick the bright pass",
      "cmd": "click",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_node#render_fullscreen"
    },
    {
      "label": "its Pass fields",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPass.shader.fragment",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "label": "the engine's bright pass",
      "cmd": "select",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasPass.shader.fragment",
      "text": "engine://bloom_highpass"
    },
    {
      "label": "saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Graph change saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "the engine has presented frames",
      "cmd": "wait_engine",
      "timeout_ms": 180000,
      "frames": 30
    },
    {
      "label": "RS-8: the bright pass draws with engine://bloom_highpass, no define given",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_graph_instances",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[5].parameters.shader.fragment",
      "value": "engine://bloom_highpass",
      "retry_ms": 30000
    },
    {
      "label": "fit",
      "cmd": "action",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvas.fitView"
    },
    {
      "label": "present offers an empty + input",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_derived_socket#present/in:+",
      "visible": true,
      "timeout_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "before",
      "expect": "result",
      "command": {
        "cmd": "screenshot",
        "name": "pelican.viewportHost",
        "mode": "screen",
        "path": "{artifacts}/before.png",
        "pixels": [
          [
            0.5,
            0.5
          ]
        ]
      },
      "path": "pixels[0]",
      "remember": "gradient_middle"
    },
    {
      "label": "UX-5c, decision 1: the loop's output (p: the last element's value) onto present's + input",
      "cmd": "drag",
      "from": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_socket#loop/out:color"
      },
      "to": {
        "name": "pelican.graphCanvasView::graph_derived_socket#present/in:+"
      },
      "steps": 8
    },
    {
      "label": "the engine takes it (RS-13): present's inputs saved",
      "cmd": "wait",
      "name": "pelican.graphCanvasNotice",
      "text": "Pass inputs saved.",
      "timeout_ms": 120000
    },
    {
      "label": "the document names the loop's output, not a copy's image",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_render_authoring_context",
      "params": {},
      "path": "graphs[0].passes[6].root_declaration.input[0]",
      "value": "loop.color",
      "retry_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "present stands after the loop's last copy",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[6].name",
      "value": "present",
      "retry_ms": 60000
    },
    {
      "label": "the plan says what loop.color named this frame",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[6].loop_outputs[0].reference",
      "value": "loop.color"
    },
    {
      "label": "the last copy's image",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
      "path": "nodes[6].loop_outputs[0].resource",
      "value": "loop/3/render_fullscreen__color"
    },
    {
      "label": "which present reads",
      "expect": "rpc_equals",
      "method": "get_frame_plan",
      "params": {},
